#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:70
msgid "CAN bus driver implementation roadmap"
msgstr "CAN 总线驱动程序实现路线图"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:5 274baf7240794517af295a8b207ef948
msgid "CAN bus and UAVCAN/DroneCAN protocol"
msgstr "CAN 总线与 UAVCAN/DroneCAN 协议"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:7 b1c6cfb61a31408fa8277c5781002352
msgid "Support for CAN bus messaging in ArduPilot relies on two parts:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中 CAN 总线消息支持依赖于两个部分："

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:9 8f168473fa804928851b8982c5999d31
msgid "Hardware CAN bus support that is done with HAL drivers"
msgstr "通过 HAL 驱动程序实现的硬件 CAN 总线支持"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:10 07428b5594cf456fbd2e1f202f8622cf
msgid ""
"UAVCAN/DroneCAN protocol which is responsible for handling all high level "
"work"
msgstr "负责处理所有高级工作的 UAVCAN/DroneCAN 协议"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:13 2e4f4e5f216e401aa8b9c9067208444f
msgid "CAN bus support in ArduPilot"
msgstr "ArduPilot 中的 CAN 总线支持"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:15 c229628a29c14206b16d7e997fd5aee3
msgid ""
"The base for hardware CAN bus support is located in AP_HAL library and "
"consist of two classes:"
msgstr "硬件 CAN 总线支持的基础位于 AP_HAL 库中，由两个类组成："

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:18 4692710393474b408e3b2e18b451b504
msgid ""
"CAN class that is responsible for representation of one physical interface "
"on board. This class manages opening, setup and operation of the interface "
"and is a main connection point between software and hardware"
msgstr "CAN 类负责表示板上的一个物理接口。该类管理接口的打开、设置和操作，是软件与硬件之间的主要连接点"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:22 e38dbd3f130d40e2b73c7ae6d98202c5
msgid ""
"CANManager class is wrapping all physical interfaces. It does enumeration of"
" interfaces, provides access to them and also holds connection point for "
"accessing UAVCAN managing class."
msgstr "CANManager 类封装了所有物理接口。它负责接口枚举、提供访问方式，并持有访问 UAVCAN 管理类的连接点。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:26 f624acd2d862448bad30dfe0e24e213c
msgid ""
"As a guide for implementing CAN bus support for new hardware, following "
":ref:`roadmap <can-bus-driver-roadmap>` can be used."
msgstr "作为为新硬件实现 CAN 总线支持的指南，可使用以下 :ref:`路线图 <can-bus-driver-roadmap>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:29 63cc1280f98a4a1a9074461bec2631a7
msgid "UAVCAN/DroneCAN protocol"
msgstr "UAVCAN/DroneCAN 协议"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:31 c25604565b9f4519b6d453bc1d764f51
msgid ""
"The support for UAVCAN protocol is based on AP_UAVCAN class that is wrapping"
" interaction with Libuavcan and provides access points for other libraries "
"present in ArduPilot. It is responsible for sending the messages over CAN "
"bus with UAVCAN protocol, receiving the messages, translation of messages to"
" form that is acceptable to other libraries and provide cyclic update of "
"Libuavcan."
msgstr ""
"UAVCAN 协议的支持基于 AP_UAVCAN 类，该类封装了与 Libuavcan 的交互，并为 ArduPilot "
"中的其他库提供访问点。它负责通过 CAN 总线使用 UAVCAN 协议发送消息、接收消息、将消息转换为其他库可接受的形式，以及对 Libuavcan "
"进行周期性更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:37 e3f86e1c84d344b7b8c70a473352191e
msgid ""
"UAVCAN has evolved into DroneCAN. The terms are sometimes used "
"interchangeably, but ArduPilot uses the DroneCAN specification now, while "
"UAVCAN is evolving separately."
msgstr ""
"UAVCAN 已演变为 DroneCAN。这两个术语有时可互换使用，但 ArduPilot 现在使用 DroneCAN 规范，而 UAVCAN "
"正在单独演进。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:39 938ab5d4593f46fa92e9c10d08a98128
msgid "The AP_UAVCAN class supports following messages:"
msgstr "AP_UAVCAN 类支持以下消息："

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:41 7deb99c378684919b1b2686f0655355d
msgid "Transmission of 1010.ArrayCommand to servos"
msgstr "向舵机发送 1010.ArrayCommand"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:43 dff07de54972481d8c0b7925432e4af6
msgid "Receiving of 1001.MagneticFieldStrength"
msgstr "接收 1001.MagneticFieldStrength"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:45 e355cdd1e51e4ee5bc797fad56792082
msgid "Receiving of 1028.StaticPressure"
msgstr "接收 1028.StaticPressure"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:47 5645ed008f9241719d85248ce41c17b6
msgid "Receiving of 1029.StaticTemperature"
msgstr "接收 1029.StaticTemperature"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:49 5bf405b02583446c8b57f44828a75984
msgid "Transmission of 1030.RawCommand to ESCs"
msgstr "向 ESC 发送 1030.RawCommand"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:51 ebdc32e382c24d39a0e03a6d84063e85
msgid "Receiving of 1060.Fix from GNSS"
msgstr "从 GNSS 接收 1060.Fix"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:53 6861ffb4e9334e13a7043a06b5a325ac
msgid "Receiving of 1061.Auxiliary from GNSS"
msgstr "从 GNSS 接收 1061.Auxiliary"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:55 e80065043bb743998ec0907e1b81f9f2
msgid ""
"Processing of all incoming messages is made in the AP_UAVCAN class and the "
"messages are translated into the form that is best suited for other "
"libraries. The libraries that consume or transmit data should not include "
"the UAVCAN header files from UAVCAN module, but instead should send all data"
" to AP_UAVCAN class in their own preferable way."
msgstr ""
"所有传入消息的处理在 AP_UAVCAN 类中完成，消息被转换为最适合其他库的形式。消费或发送数据的库不应从 UAVCAN 模块中包含 UAVCAN "
"头文件，而应以各自喜欢的方式将所有数据发送到 AP_UAVCAN 类。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:61 880d0275ce104fd0ae725b40369a2672
msgid "Initialization description"
msgstr "初始化说明"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:63 4124d14360ab4d09a442d0207060c465
msgid ""
"The following initialization is based on Pixhawk hardware and is provided as"
" example."
msgstr "以下初始化基于 Pixhawk 硬件，仅作为示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/can-bus.rst:67 b6dda4a2a8e74f3eacd86add451b31c8
msgid ""
"Depending on type of board and underlying hardware, other actions may need "
"to be taken for creation of CAN driver and UAVCAN interface class."
msgstr "根据开发板类型和底层硬件，创建 CAN 驱动程序和 UAVCAN 接口类可能需要采取其他操作。"
